{"title":"What should I ask John Arnold?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916682381/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-John-Arnold.html","date":1744655699000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  John might be the smartest person I know about the energy sector and also about philanthropy.  Here is the opening of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_D._Arnold\" target=\"_blank\">his Wikipedia entry</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><b>John Douglas Arnold</b> (born 1974<sup></sup>) is an American philanthropist, former <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enron\">Enron</a> executive, and founder of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnold_Ventures_LLC\">Arnold Ventures LLC</a>, formerly the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laura_and_John_Arnold_Foundation\">Laura and John Arnold Foundation</a>. In 2007, Arnold became the youngest billionaire in the U.S.<sup></sup> His firm, Centaurus Advisors, LLC, was a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Houston\">Houston</a>-based hedge fund specializing in trading energy products that closed in 2012.<sup></sup><sup></sup><sup></sup><sup></sup><sup></sup><sup></sup> He now focuses on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philanthropy\">philanthropy</a> through Arnold Ventures LLC. Arnold is a board member of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakthrough_Energy_Ventures\">Breakthrough Energy Ventures</a> and since February 2024, is a member of the board of directors of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta_Platforms\">Meta</a>.<sup></sup></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/what-should-i-ask-john-arnold.html\">What should I ask John Arnold?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/916682381/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/916682381/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/916682381/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/916682381/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/916682381/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/916682381/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/what-should-i-ask-john-arnold.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/what-should-i-ask-john-arnold.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/what-should-i-ask-john-arnold.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/what-should-i-ask-john-arnold.html#comment-160901453\">Any thoughts on the EU's bold new package of 